  "description": "<p data-start=\"200\" data-end=\"501\">Beleef twee epische avonturen in één pakket met de <strong data-start=\"251\" data-end=\"294\">Uncharted: Legacy of Thieves Collection</strong> voor PS5. Deze remaster bevat <em data-start=\"325\" data-end=\"353\">Uncharted 4: A Thief’s End</em> en <em data-start=\"357\" data-end=\"385\">Uncharted: The Lost Legacy</em>, volledig geoptimaliseerd voor PlayStation 5 met verbeterde graphics, snellere laadtijden en performance tot 60FPS.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"503\" data-end=\"672\">Dit exemplaar is volledig getest, <strong data-start=\"537\" data-end=\"557\">100% functioneel</strong> en verkeert <strong data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"588\">In Nette Staat</strong>.<br data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"592\"><em data-start=\"592\" data-end=\"672\">(Laat me weten of het een losse disc of complete set is — dan pas ik dat aan.)</em></p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"691\">⭐ Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"1011\">\r\n<li data-start=\"692\" data-end=\"733\">\r\n<p data-start=\"694\" data-end=\"733\">🎮 <strong data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"731\">Twee topgames in één collectie</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"734\" data-end=\"800\">\r\n<p data-start=\"736\" data-end=\"800\">⚡ PS5-optimalisatie: 4K, 60FPS modes en ultrasnelle laadtijden</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"801\" data-end=\"864\">\r\n<p data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"864\">🌍 Cinematische actie-avonturen met spectaculaire setpieces</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"924\">\r\n<p data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"924\">🧩 Prachtige omgevingen, puzzels en sterke storytelling</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"1011\">\r\n<p data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"1011\">👫 Speel als zowel Nathan Drake (<em data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"973\">Uncharted 4</em>) als Chloe & Nadine (<em data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1008\">Lost Legacy</em>)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1013\" data-end=\"1035\">📋 Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1387\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1090\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1090\"><strong data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1048\">Titel:</strong> Uncharted: Legacy of Thieves Collection</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1122\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1122\"><strong data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1106\">Platform:</strong> PlayStation 5</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1152\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1152\"><strong data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1135\">Staat:</strong> In Nette Staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1153\" data-end=\"1184\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1184\"><strong data-start=\"1155\" data-end=\"1165\">Genre:</strong> Actie / Avontuur</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1185\" data-end=\"1203\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1203\"><strong data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1199\">Spelers:</strong> 1</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1204\" data-end=\"1295\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1229\"><strong data-start=\"1206\" data-end=\"1227\">Games inbegrepen:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1295\">\r\n<li data-start=\"1232\" data-end=\"1262\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1262\">Uncharted 4: A Thief’s End</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1265\" data-end=\"1295\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1267\" data-end=\"1295\">Uncharted: The Lost Legacy</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1296\" data-end=\"1358\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1298\" data-end=\"1358\"><strong data-start=\"1298\" data-end=\"1316\">Ondersteuning:</strong> 4K, 60FPS, 3D Audio, haptische feedback</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1387\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1387\"><strong data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1381\">Compatibiliteit:</strong> PS5</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"1389\" data-end=\"1422\"><strong data-start=\"1393\" data-end=\"1412\">Incl. Garantie:</strong> 1 maand</h3>",
